{
  "slug": "runway-api",
  "name": "Runway Api",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Video generation at scale. Generate videos, images, and audio with Runway's API — batch ad campaigns, product videos, multishot stories, and creative iteration. Supports seedance2, gen4.5, veo3, Nano, Banana Pro, and more.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **11 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (11): `runway-dev` (Foundation for building, modifying, debugging, or verifying Runway Dev Platform integrations in an application: connect Dev MCP, use…), `runway-dev-characters` (Build, modify, debug, or verify Runway Characters integrations: inspect preset or custom avatars with MCP, manage live Sessions…), `runway-dev-model-routers` (Build, modify, debug, or verify Runway Model Routers: inspect live config and eligible models via MCP, manage approved…), `runway-dev-models` (Build, modify, debug, or verify Runway model generation in an application: discover accessible models and constraints with MCP,…), `runway-dev-recipes` (Choose, build, modify, debug, or verify Runway recipe integrations: match a recipe to the user's use case, follow…), `runway-dev-workflows` (Build, modify, debug, or verify integrations that expose Runway app workflows as API endpoints), `rw-check-org-details` (Query the Runway API for organization details: rate limits, credit balance, usage tier, and daily generation counts), `rw-generate-audio` (Generate audio using the Runway API via runnable scripts), and 3 more\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install runway-api@claude-plugins-official` from `runwayml/skills`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
